# `extend` adds columns at the end, replaces one in place, and sees earlier items (D-040).
mode: run
---- query
from '../../../data/orders.csv'
| where orderId == 'o-0001'
| extend doubled = amount * 2, amount = amount + 1, again = doubled + 1
| project-away timestamp
---- expected
orderId | customerId | amount | doubled | again
string  | string     | real   | real    | real
--------+------------+--------+---------+------
o-0001  | c-042      |  184.5 |   367.0 | 368.0
